---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Cairns Skin handles personal information." noindex={false}>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-prose px-5 md:px-8 py-14 md:py-20">
    <h1 class="mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      Cairns Skin is an educational website. It does not require an account
      and does not collect personal information through forms. It does use
      Google Analytics to understand how the site is used, described below.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 mb-3">Information we collect</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      We do not collect personal information directly through this website.
      There are no sign-ups, accounts, contact forms or newsletter sign-ups
      that store your details with us.
    </p>
    <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      Our hosting provider, Netlify, automatically records standard technical
      logs for every website it serves, such as IP address, browser type,
      and the page requested, as part of normal web hosting and security
      operations. This happens at the hosting level rather than something
      Cairns Skin actively collects or has access to for tracking purposes.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 mb-3">Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      This website uses Google Analytics to understand which pages are read
      and how visitors reach the site, for example whether they arrived from
      a search engine or an AI assistant such as ChatGPT. Google Analytics
      uses cookies and collects information such as your approximate
      location, device and browser type, and the pages you view. This
      information is sent to and processed by Google, which may store it on
      servers outside Australia.
    </p>
    <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      We do not use this data to identify individual visitors, and we do not
      combine it with any other information about you. You can opt out of
      Google Analytics using a browser extension such as Google's Analytics
      Opt-out Add-on, or by using your browser's cookie and tracking
      controls. See
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Privacy Policy</a>
      for details on how Google handles this information.
    </p>
    <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      We do not use advertising trackers, and we do not use any analytics
      tool beyond Google Analytics. If that changes, this policy will be
      updated first.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 mb-3">Links to Laser Clinics Cairns</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      This website is connected to Laser Clinics Cairns, and pages such as
      "Book a Consultation" link directly to Laser Clinics Australia's own
      website and booking system. Once you leave cairnsskin.com.au, any
      information you provide, for example to book a consultation, is
      collected and handled under Laser Clinics Australia's own privacy
      policy, not this one. We'd encourage you to review their policy
      directly before providing any personal details.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 mb-3">Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      If the way this website operates changes, for example if analytics,
      a contact form, or other data collection is introduced, this page will
      be updated to reflect that before any such feature goes live.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 mb-3">Contact</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
      Questions about this privacy policy or this website can be sent using
      the details on our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
